.mdx","ru:dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/oauth-server.mdx","OAuth Authorization Server","Как сайт DLE выдаёт токены: discovery, authorize, credential_type и curl.","/dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/oauth-server","dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/oauth-server.mdx","ru:dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/oauth-client.mdx","OAuth-клиенты","Как завести приложение в админке DLE API: ключ, grants, redirect, секрет.","/dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/oauth-client","dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/oauth-client.mdx","ru:dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/auth.mdx","Авторизация","Как получить пропуск (Bearer) и ходить в /api/v2: AuthToken, /me, /key/check.","/dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/auth","dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/guides/auth.mdx","ru:dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/install.mdx","Особые шаги DLE API после общей установки плагина DevCraft.","/dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/install","dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/install.mdx","ru:dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/getting_started.mdx","Неофициальное REST API для DataLife Engine 20.0 (/api/v2).","/dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/getting_started","dev/dle/dle_api/200.1.0/getting_started.mdx","DevCraft Admin",[983],"ru:dev/dle/devcraft_admin",{"_40":981,"_49":982},"dev/dle/devcraft_admin","dev/dle/devcraft_admin/meta.json",{"_21":40,"_27":984,"_22":460,"_42":-7,"_29":-7,"_43":-7,"_30":985,"_25":986,"_23":987,"_47":-7},"200.4.0",[990,991,992,993,994,995],"ru:dev/dle/devcraft_admin/200.4.0",{"_40":988,"_49":989},"dev/dle/devcraft_admin/200.4.0","dev/dle/devcraft_admin/200.4.0/meta.json",{"_25":1614,"_21":71,"_27":492,"_29":1615,"_47":-7,"_73":1616,"_23":1617},{"_25":1610,"_21":71,"_27":487,"_29":1611,"_47":-7,"_73":1612,"_23":1613},{"_25":1605,"_21":71,"_27":1606,"_29":1607,"_47":-7,"_73":1608,"_23":1609},{"_21":40,"_27":606,"_22":-7,"_42":-7,"_29":-7,"_43":-7,"_30":1566,"_25":1567,"_23":1568,"_47":-7},{"_21":40,"_27":590,"_22":-7,"_42":-7,"_29":-7,"_43":-7,"_30":1000,"_25":1001,"_23":1002,"_47":-7},{"_25":996,"_21":71,"_27":210,"_29":997,"_47":-7,"_73":998,"_23":999},"ru:dev/dle